OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry at first, but rain
OL,6,Fwill soon spread in from the west,
OL,7,Fbecoming widespread, persistent and
OL,8,Flocally heavy, especially over higher
OL,9,Fground. Conditions should gradually
OL,10,Fturn drier later in the afternoon as
OL,11,Fthe rain clears away. Turning breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBreezy with variable cloud,
OL,14,Fallowing some clear spells at times,
OL,15,Fthough the odd spot of rain cannot be
OL,16,Fruled out. Remaining mild overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
