OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FBrightening through the
OL,6,Fmorning with widespread sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping. Cloud soon thickening from
OL,8,Fthe west, bringing the risk of a
OL,9,Flittle rain later in the day.
OL,10,FRemaining breezy throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy on
OL,13,FFriday, with rain slowly clearing
OL,14,Fsoutheastwards. Sunny spells and
OL,15,Fisolated showers later. Largely dry
OL,16,FSaturday, with lighter winds. Sunny
OL,17,Fand warm Sunday, but turning wet and
OL,18,Fwindy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
